{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","炸裂吧！战车！"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","打造一辆玩具车或者控制玩具车致盲敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，达米安在战斗中不会被攻击，战斗开始时会在布阵位置打造一辆玩具车，继承自身85% + 10%的生命值和100%的其他属性，随后自身退至场外，并会在场上其他友军全部被击败后撤离战场。使用终极技能时，若场上已有玩具车，则驱使玩具车冲向目标位置爆炸，玩具车爆炸时每剩余10%生命值会使达米安恢复80点能量，并对1格范围的敌人造成320% ATK伤害并施加致盲，持续3秒；若场上没有玩具车，则会打造一辆新的玩具车并移动至目标位置。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":164,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":177,"end":179,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至350% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","紧急救援！"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","控制玩具车回复友军生命值或自身回复能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若场上已有玩具车，则控制玩具车为3格范围内最虚弱的一名友军奏乐，使其回复4次-120% − 10% ATK生命值。若场上没有玩具车，则使达米安回复300点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":38,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-130% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-140% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-150% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","小飞机来喽！"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","控制玩具飞机眩晕最远的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","控制玩具飞机飞向最远的敌人并对其投掷烟花弹，造成250% + 20% ATK伤害，并使目标眩晕3秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","眩晕时间提升至5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至275% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","发明家意志"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","玩具车提升周围友方英雄急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每一辆玩具车在首次响应“紧急救援！”时会展开音乐光环，对周围2格的非召唤物友军进行鼓舞，提升其40点急速，持续10秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","期间还会每秒使周围2格的友军回复-80% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对非召唤物友军进行鼓舞提升其50点急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对非召唤物友军进行鼓舞提升其55点急速。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“炸裂吧！战车！”在玩具车剩余生命值较高时，致盲持续时间提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“炸裂吧！战车！”在玩具车剩余生命值百分比高于50%时，造成的致盲的持续时间提升至7秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“紧急救援”时，若场上有玩具车，玩具车治疗友军距离提高到全场，且额外选择一名友军进行治疗；场上无玩具车时，自身额外选择一名最虚弱的友军，使其回复300% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","花朵指挥棒"]]}